0. THE SHORT VERSION

This is a plain-English summary for humans. It is not the license —
the binding terms are in sections 1–10 below. If they ever disagree,
the detailed terms win.

  FREE — you may:
   ✅  Run Vigil on any Discord server you want, including servers
       you monetize (paid memberships, donations, ads, boosts).
   ✅  Read, change, and extend the source code however you like.
   ✅  Share the original or your modified version with anyone —
       for free, under this same license, with credit intact.
   ✅  Charge for your own work around the software: installing it,
       hosting it for a client, maintaining it, or building custom
       features on it. Your labor is yours.
   ✅  Rebrand your own deployment (dashboard title, bot username,
       accent colors) — that's configuration the product supports.

  NOT FREE — you may not:
   ❌  Sell the software itself, or any modified version of it —
       no price tags on the code, no code marketplaces, no
       "buy access" repos, no license-key paywalls.
   ❌  Present it as your own original work, strip the copyright
       and attribution notices, or claim you wrote Vigil.
   ❌  Use the "Vigil" name or logo to brand a different product,
       or register them as your own trademark.

The one-sentence version: **use it, change it, share it — but the code
stays free, the credit stays with the author, and nobody sells Vigil.
Not you, not anyone — the author included.**

