 7.3  First breach, cured fast: if you receive notice of breach and
      fully cure it within 30 days, your rights are reinstated. A
      second breach of the same term, or any breach of 4.1, 4.2, or
      4.3, terminates this license permanently.

 7.4  Sections 1, 4, 6, 7, 8, and 9 survive termination. On
      termination you must stop distributing the Software and
      Modified Versions, and destroy or cease all commercial use of
      your copies.

